.\" DO NOT MODIFY THIS FILE!  It was generated by help2man 1.49.3.
.TH SMBIOS-BATTERY-CTL "1" "December 2025" "smbios-battery-ctl 2.4.3" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
smbios-battery-ctl \- ../src/bin/smbios-battery-ctl
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B smbios-battery-ctl

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
show program's version number and exit
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
show this help message and exit
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Display more verbose output.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Minimize program output. Only errors and warnings are
displayed.
.TP
\fB\-\-trace\fR
Enable verbose function tracing.
.TP
\fB\-\-logconfig\fR=\fI\,LOGCONFIG\/\fR
Specify alternate config log.
.TP
\fB\-\-security\-key\fR=\fI\,SECURITY_KEY\/\fR
BIOS pre\-calculated security key.
.TP
\fB\-\-password\fR=\fI\,PASSWORD\/\fR
BIOS Setup password for set/activate operations.
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-rawpassword\fR
Do not auto\-convert password to scancodes.
.TP
\fB\-\-memory\-dat\fR=\fI\,MEMORY_DAT\/\fR
Path to a memory dump file to use instead of real RAM
.TP
\fB\-\-cmos\-dat\fR=\fI\,CMOS_DAT\/\fR
Path to a CMOS dump file to use instead of real CMOS
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-battery\-charge\fR
This will get the Current Battery Charging State
.TP
\fB\-\-get\-charging\-cfg\fR
Get the current Primary Battery Charge Configuration
.TP
\fB\-\-set\-charging\-mode=\fR<MODE>
Set the current Primary Battery Charge Configuration.
Valid choices are: ['primarily_ac', 'adaptive',
\&'custom', 'standard', 'express']
.TP
\fB\-\-set\-custom\-charge\-interval=\fR<START> <END>
Set the percentage bounds for custom charge. Both must
be integers. START must lie in the range [50, 95], END
must lie in the range [55, 100], END must be at least
(START + 5)
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
The full documentation for
.B smbios-battery-ctl
is maintained as a Texinfo manual.  If the
.B info
and
.B smbios-battery-ctl
programs are properly installed at your site, the command
.IP
.B info smbios-battery-ctl
.PP
should give you access to the complete manual.
